elevenlabs, figma, github, gitlab, google, googlechrome, grafana, huggingface, imessage, instagram, intercom, linear,
mapbox, miro, modelcontextprotocol, neon, netlify, notion, perplexity, posthog, postman, sentry, stripe, supabase,
todoist, vercel, webflow, wix, x and zapier. Each file keeps the icon's path alone.

